abstract: >
  Python data acquisition system for the NIST Building 423 Indoor Air Quality
  (IAQ) Manufactured House. It reads an NI cDAQ-9178 chassis (five NI 9201
  voltage modules and one NI 9213 thermocouple module) and a Met One AIO 2
  weather sensor, averages 1 kHz samples into 1 s records, scales voltages to
  SI units, writes daily raw and SI files, mirrors them to network storage,
  sends alarm email, and serves a live dashboard and weather page. Version
  2.0.0 replaces the LabVIEW acquisition VIs and the v1 file backup scripts.
keywords:
